- Story & Context: In the hushed, cavernous food court of the Arcadia Mall, a girl named Marisa once fed her last quarter into a broken Centipede machine, only for its screen to flicker not with a game, but a fragmented image of her own future, causing a strange, resonant hum that drew the first curious teens. "This quarter, a new chronology."
