Track 3: 432 Cycles to Next Tuesday
- Story & Context: The legend began that if you synchronized all the rewired arcade cabinet lights to a perfect, unbroken 432Hz sine wave during a particularly misty Tuesday night, a door would open not to another dimension, but merely to an unexpected, brighter corner of the same dilapidated mall. "We calibrated the portal, it just leads to more stairs."
